# circleci_project (Resource)

Manages a CircleCI project and its advanced settings.

## Example Usage

```terraform
resource "circleci_project" "example" {
  organization_id = "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
  name            = "my-repo"

  auto_cancel_builds            = true
  build_fork_prs                = false
  disable_ssh                   = true
  # Set this explicitly whenever oss is managed. Changing oss can leave it with
  # a different value on CircleCI's side, and an attribute the configuration
  # omits is never reported as a change.
  forks_receive_secret_env_vars = false
  # CircleCI only applies oss = true to a project whose repository is open
  # source. On any other project the apply fails and the flag stays disabled.
  oss                           = true
  set_github_status             = true
  setup_workflows               = false
  write_settings_requires_admin = false
  pr_only_branch_overrides      = ["main", "develop"]
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

Import is supported using the project slug (`vcs-type/org-name/repo-name`):

```shell
terraform import circleci_project.example "github/my-org/my-repo"
```
